                            "text": "He caught the early train down to <w>Dandy</w> this morning.",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
                                "es": "Tomó el tren temprano hacia <w>Dandenong</w> esta mañana."
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "They used to live out in <w>Dandy</w> before moving closer to the city.",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
